@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · 环境要求：- DSH `>=0.1.2-alpha.2`
- Web Profile
- Node.js 内置 `zlib`（无需额外安装 `zstd` 命令行工具）

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · 或使用 pnpm：pnpm add -w @mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager
```

安装完成后，请确认 `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/package.json`（未设置 `DSH_HOME` 时为 `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`）中的 `dsh.profile.bundles` 数组已包含 `@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager`：

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · 或使用 pnpm：```json
{
  "name": "dsh-profile-web",
  "private": true,
  "dependencies": {
    "@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager": "^1.0.10"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app",
        "@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

---

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · 🚀 启动与体验：启动 DSH Web 服务：

```bash
dsh --profile web

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · Requirements：- DSH `>=0.1.2-alpha.2`
- The Web Profile
- Node.js built-in `zlib` (no external `zstd` CLI is required)

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · or with pnpm：pnpm add -w @mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager
```

After installation, make sure `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/package.json` (`~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` when `DSH_HOME` is unset) contains `@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager` in its `dsh.profile.bundles` array:

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · or with pnpm：```json
{
  "name": "dsh-profile-web",
  "private": true,
  "dependencies": {
    "@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager": "^1.0.10"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app",
        "@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · Usage：Start the DSH web service:

```bash
dsh --profile web

@mlgbnb/dsh-archive-manager README · or：dsh web
```

Open [http://127.0.0.1:3080/](http://127.0.0.1:3080/), click the gear icon at the bottom of the sidebar, and enter **Settings -> Plugins**. The "Archive Manager" card will appear there.
